(# FHIR Retriever: User and Technical Documentation) Tj
0 -12 Td
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
(## 1. Purpose) Tj
0 -12 Td
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
(This project downloads a selected FHIR R4 Patient cohort from) Tj
0 -12 Td
(`http://hapi.fhir.org/baseR4`, stores Patient, Condition, Observation, and Encounter) Tj
0 -12 Td
(data in SQLite and CSV files, and exposes the stored data through an HTTP API.) Tj
0 -12 Td
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
(The normal flow is:) Tj
0 -12 Td
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
(```text) Tj
0 -12 Td
(FHIR endpoint -> retrieval -> pseudonymization -> SQLite/CSV -> analysis/API) Tj
0 -12 Td
(```) Tj
0 -12 Td
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
(## 2. Files) Tj
0 -12 Td
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| File | Purpose |) Tj
0 -12 Td
(|---|---|) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| `fhir_retriever.py` | FHIR client, cache/checkpoint handling, database loading, CSV) Tj
0 -12 Td
(export, command-line interface. |) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| `fhir_analyse.py` | Reads numeric Observations from SQLite and calculates descriptive) Tj
0 -12 Td
(statistics. |) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| `fhir_api.py` | FastAPI HTTP service over the stored SQLite data. |) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| `etl.py` | Compose ETL entry point: retrieve the configured cohort, load it, then) Tj
0 -12 Td
(create an analysis result. |) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| `test_fhir_retriever.py` | Retrieval, cache, database, and resource-selection tests. |) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| `test_fhir_analyse.py` | Statistics and analysis-output tests. |) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| `test_fhir_api.py` | HTTP API smoke tests. |) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| `test_encounter_link_repair.py` | Migration test for legacy Encounter/Observation ID) Tj
0 -12 Td
(linking. |) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| `Dockerfile`, `docker-compose.yml`, `.env.example` | Container build, orchestration,) Tj
0 -12 Td
(and environment configuration. |) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| `generate_documentation_pdf.py` | Regenerates this PDF from) Tj
0 -12 Td
(`docs/TECHNICAL_USER_DOCUMENTATION.md`. |) Tj
0 -12 Td
( ) Tj
