(## 3. Setup) Tj
0 -12 Td
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
(Install dependencies \(a virtual environment is recommended\):) Tj
0 -12 Td
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
(```bash) Tj
0 -12 Td
(python -m venv .venv) Tj
0 -12 Td
(source .venv/bin/activate) Tj
0 -12 Td
(python -m pip install -r requirements.txt) Tj
0 -12 Td
(```) Tj
0 -12 Td
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
(Set the pseudonymization key in the current shell:) Tj
0 -12 Td
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
(```bash) Tj
0 -12 Td
(export FHIR_PSEUDONYMIZATION_KEY='replace-with-a-long-private-random-value') Tj
0 -12 Td
(```) Tj
0 -12 Td
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
(The key is not a Patient ID. It is the secret used by HMAC-SHA256 to turn source FHIR) Tj
0 -12 Td
(identifiers into stable pseudonyms. The same secret must be used whenever the same) Tj
0 -12 Td
(dataset is updated, otherwise new pseudonyms will not match older rows, and single-) Tj
0 -12 Td
(Patient commands will not recognize previously cached data for that Patient.) Tj
0 -12 Td
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
