0 -12 Td
(patients.patient_id -> observations.patient_id) Tj
0 -12 Td
(patients.patient_id -> encounters.patient_id) Tj
0 -12 Td
(encounters.encounter_id -> observations.encounter_id) Tj
0 -12 Td
(encounters.encounter_id -> conditions.encounter_id) Tj
0 -12 Td
(```) Tj
0 -12 Td
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
(SQLite stores ISO dates as `TEXT`; this is standard SQLite practice because it does not) Tj
0 -12 Td
(provide a dedicated date storage class.) Tj
